src/pareto.rs is a Rust port derived from the C++ code of bitehv2.h in
Aleksey Vaneev's BiteOpt repository (https://github.com/avaneev/biteopt,
commit 5f86f50, 2026-10-13). The Rust port is by Dietmar Wolz; Aleksey
Vaneev's copyright covers the original C++ code. Both are distributed under:

